  "description": "A managed, cross-platform music engraving engine for .NET, ported from GNU LilyPond 2.27.2. The complete engine is ported — parser, Scheme layer, engravers, page layout, fonts, SVG and MIDI output — and is verified page-for-page against LilyPond's own 2,146-file regression suite. Licensed GPL-3.0-only (not -or-later) because it includes LilyPond's articulate.ly, which is GPL-3-only.",
